exports[`ResearchCanvasView renderToStaticMarkup（ONE 回放，04 §5.3 第 2 条） 第 63 行：等待测量 P2 1`] = `"<div class="flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden bg-content-area text-foreground titlebar-no-drag"><div class="flex h-[34px] flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-b border-border/30 px-3"><span class="truncate text-xs font-medium">研究画布 · ca_rebound</span><span class="truncate text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">回放 · 只读 · research/campaigns/2026-10-14-glm53flash-oneline-ca_rebound</span><div class="ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><button type="button" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground" aria-label="关闭研究画布"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-3.5"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="min-h-0 flex-1 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto p-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"><div class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1.5"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">进度</div><div class="text-[13px] tabular-nums">已测 1 次 · 预算已用 3</div></div><div class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1.5"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">账本检查</div><div class="text-[13px] tabular-nums">未声明</div></div><div class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card px-2 py-1.5"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">科学结论</div><div class="text-[13px] tabular-nums">尚无定论</div></div></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><span class="shrink-0 tabular-nums">第 63 / 105 行</span><input type="range" min="1" max="105" class="w-full accent-primary" aria-label="回放到运行记录第几行" value="63"/></label></div><section class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card p-3" aria-label="当前焦点"><div class="mb-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">当前问题</div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold">等待测量 P2</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">P2：brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA) · 重复 1 次</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">同协议候选仿真值 13–20（8 次；候选参数未记录，含参数差异）</p><p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1 text-[12px] text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" title="画布标记：宿主不强制"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 size-3 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>M-reps · 只测 1 次就要分清 3 种解释</span></p></section><section class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card p-3"><h3 class="mb-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">假设与证据</h3><p class="mb-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">派生关系未记录</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-[12px]"><thead><tr class="text-left text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><th class="py-1 pr-2 font-normal">假设（派生）</th><th class="py-1 pr-2 font-normal">状态</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" class="hover:underline">P1（3 次）</button></th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" class="hover:underline">P2（1 次）</button></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-border/60 align-top"><td class="py-1 pr-2" style="padding-left:0"><button type="button" class="text-left hover:underline"><span class="font-medium">H1</span> <span title="ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2">◐ 收窄</td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1">◐ 收窄</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">◌ 待测</span></button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border/60 align-top"><td class="py-1 pr-2" style="padding-left:0"><button type="button" class="text-left hover:underline"><span class="font-medium">H2</span> <span title="ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2">? 有争议</td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground border border-dashed border-border" title="无探针的迁移：判断，非测量">· 带外 · 判断，非测量（第 53 行）</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">◌ 待测</span></button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border/60 align-top"><td class="py-1 pr-2" style="padding-left:0"><button type="button" class="text-left hover:underline"><span class="font-medium">H3</span> <span title="额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2">○ 未定</td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">· 带外</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">◌ 待测</span></button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border/60 align-top"><td class="py-1 pr-2" style="padding-left:0"><button type="button" class="text-left hover:underline"><span class="font-medium">H4</span> <span title="H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2">○ 未定</td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">— 未登记带</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">◌ 待测</span></button></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border/60 align-top"><td class="py-1 pr-2" style="padding-left:0"><button type="button" class="text-left hover:underline"><span class="font-medium">H5</span> <span title="H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2">○ 未定</td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">— 未登记带</span></button></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 tabular-nums"><button type="button"><span class="inline-block rounded px-1 text-muted-foreground">◌ 待测</span></button></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="rounded-md border border-border bg-card p-3"><h3 class="mb-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">阶段报告</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-[13px]"><li>已知：H1 SCOPED</li><li>未知：H2 CONTESTED；H3 LIVE；H4 LIVE</li><li>下一步：等待测量 P2</li></ul></section></div></div>"`;

